\doxysubsection{Detailed Description}
Defines the Networked\+Entity component used for network replication. 

Each entity that should be replicated across the network includes this component. It stores a globally unique {\ttfamily network\+\_\+id} assigned by the server and a bitmask of {\ttfamily interest\+\_\+groups} which determines which clients should receive updates for this entity. 